# Netlify

> Netlify is the composable web platform for building, deploying, and scaling modern web projects — and the agents that build them. Every page below is also available as Markdown by appending `.md` (or sending `Accept: text/markdown`).

## Platform

- [Platform overview](https://www.netlify.com/platform.md): The Netlify composable web platform.
- [Build](https://www.netlify.com/platform/core/build.md): Continuous deployment and build infrastructure.
- [Edge](https://www.netlify.com/platform/core/edge.md): Netlify's global edge network.
- [Agent Runners](https://www.netlify.com/platform/agent-runners.md): Run AI coding agents against your repo on Netlify.
- [AI Gateway](https://www.netlify.com/platform/ai-gateway.md): A managed proxy to OpenAI, Anthropic, and Gemini without provider API keys.
- [Database](https://www.netlify.com/platform/database.md): Managed Postgres built into Netlify.
- [Storage](https://www.netlify.com/platform/storage.md): Blobs and object storage.
- [Primitives](https://www.netlify.com/platform/primitives.md): Functions, edge functions, forms, and more.

## Solutions

- [Marketing sites](https://www.netlify.com/solutions/marketing-sites.md): Composable, high-performance marketing sites.
- [Ecommerce](https://www.netlify.com/solutions/ecommerce.md): Composable commerce storefronts.
- [Internal apps](https://www.netlify.com/solutions/internal-apps.md): Build and ship internal tools.
- [Prototypes](https://www.netlify.com/solutions/prototypes.md): Ship prototypes and previews fast.
- [Web applications](https://www.netlify.com/for/web-applications.md): Dynamic, full-stack web applications.

## Company

- [Pricing](https://www.netlify.com/pricing.md): Plans and pricing.
- [Customers](https://www.netlify.com/customers.md): Customer stories and results.
- [About](https://www.netlify.com/about.md): About Netlify.
- [Security](https://www.netlify.com/security.md): Security, compliance, and trust.
- [Agent experience](https://www.netlify.com/agent-experience.md): How Netlify builds for AI agents.
- [Agent authentication](https://www.netlify.com/auth.md): How AI agents get credentials for Netlify (MCP OAuth, personal access tokens, OAuth apps, CLI).
- [Careers](https://www.netlify.com/careers.md): Open roles at Netlify.
- [Contact](https://www.netlify.com/contact.md): Get in touch.

## Resources

- [Blog](https://www.netlify.com/blog.md): News, guides, and engineering posts.
- [Changelog](https://www.netlify.com/changelog.md): Product updates and releases.
- [Resources](https://www.netlify.com/resources.md): Ebooks, case studies, and more.
- [Integrations](https://www.netlify.com/integrations.md): Extensions and integrations.
- [Partners](https://www.netlify.com/partners.md): The Netlify partner network.

